WEBVTT

00:40.749 --> 00:42.709
Please, my Lady,
you must be strong!

00:42.792 --> 00:44.586
You must not lose
your consciousness.

00:44.669 --> 00:45.795
Be strong!

00:56.347 --> 00:57.182
I HAVE GONE TO BE WITH DO-HWA.

00:57.265 --> 00:58.391
WHEN SHE BEARS A CHILD,
KNOWING THAT IT IS MINE.

00:58.475 --> 00:59.809
And here I go,

01:01.061 --> 01:04.314
having spent
seven blissful days in your body.

01:09.277 --> 01:10.653
Do-hwa will…

01:11.988 --> 01:14.032
soon give birth to my son.

01:16.451 --> 01:17.494
Your Majesty.

01:18.286 --> 01:21.998
Remember the prophecy I received
the day of my coronation?

01:22.665 --> 01:26.086
You said
that I was to be granted a son

01:26.961 --> 01:30.006
who had the energy of the King's Star.

01:30.590 --> 01:34.260
The prophecy was incorrect.
It simply cannot be true.

01:36.805 --> 01:37.764
It is.

01:39.557 --> 01:42.102
Everything you said must be true.

01:43.103 --> 01:46.231
I will have a son
thanks to your Alchemy of Souls.

01:48.108 --> 01:49.317
Mark my words.

01:51.194 --> 01:53.113
The child Do-hwa bears…

01:54.823 --> 01:56.116
will be my son.

01:59.410 --> 02:00.495
My son.

02:58.720 --> 03:00.597
The star in the center
of the Big Dipper

03:00.680 --> 03:02.599
containing nature's secrets

03:02.682 --> 03:07.896
only reveals itself when the sky is filled
with the energy of Daeho's waters.

03:15.236 --> 03:18.156
And my son will be born under that star.

03:28.708 --> 03:32.003
As of this moment, Jang Uk
is forbidden from Songrim.

03:34.255 --> 03:36.132
As for the last one,
you should do it yourself.

03:52.190 --> 03:53.024
Mu-deok.

03:54.525 --> 03:57.737
Is it true?
The Young Master isn't talking?

03:58.863 --> 04:02.742
Yes. His back was flogged,
but it's his mouth that has been closed.

04:02.825 --> 04:05.161
That boy cries when he stubs his toe.

04:05.245 --> 04:07.455
But he's silent
after being flogged 100 times.

04:08.248 --> 04:09.165
That worries me.

04:09.249 --> 04:12.335
It must not be so terrible, otherwise,
he would be crying about it.

04:13.836 --> 04:17.799
Understand what hurts him the most
is not his back. His heart is in pain.

04:19.509 --> 04:22.762
He was cast away by the one man
he thought of like a father figure.

04:22.845 --> 04:24.472
Imagine how that must feel.

04:25.807 --> 04:27.225
Like he has been abandoned.

04:51.708 --> 04:53.501
It's better that you've been flogged.

04:54.210 --> 04:56.796
They won't be able to retrieve
the torrent of energy yet.

04:57.547 --> 04:59.173
You bought us time to train.

05:10.476 --> 05:11.436
Young Master.

05:12.520 --> 05:13.354
Are you all right?

05:33.583 --> 05:35.877
Hey Mu-- Mu-deok, take a look at this.

05:35.960 --> 05:38.004
I think my energy is making these ripples.

05:43.092 --> 05:44.344
The water is just rippling.

05:46.471 --> 05:48.264
Why isn't it working?
I have been practicing.

05:49.098 --> 05:51.351
Is that what you have been doing
in silence?

05:51.434 --> 05:54.645
I thought you were moping
over being abandoned by them.

05:55.229 --> 05:57.315
- I guess not.
- Moping?

05:57.398 --> 05:59.650
I was abandoned
from the very moment I was born.

05:59.734 --> 06:01.986
And it's not like
I haven't been kicked out before.

06:02.070 --> 06:03.071
It doesn't faze me.

06:09.077 --> 06:10.495
Just wait and see.

06:10.578 --> 06:14.082
One of these days they're going
to be begging me to come back to Songrim.

06:15.583 --> 06:17.168
I guess it helps that you're full of it.

06:17.835 --> 06:18.753
Of spirit.

06:22.382 --> 06:25.051
By the way, why is it so hot in here?

06:25.676 --> 06:27.303
So hot? I'm cold.

06:30.390 --> 06:32.100
Why is the water so hot?

06:34.519 --> 06:35.728
You're burning up right now.

06:37.063 --> 06:40.274
Mu-deok, I'm getting strange.
I'm getting hotter.

06:40.817 --> 06:42.068
Energy's surging.

06:43.361 --> 06:44.487
But it's so soon for that.

06:47.448 --> 06:48.616
Because of the flogging.

06:49.200 --> 06:51.202
The flogging caused
the energy to surge faster.

06:51.953 --> 06:53.413
Good thing you were flogged, Jang Uk.

06:56.624 --> 06:58.292
Mu-deok, I'm burning up right now.

06:58.376 --> 07:01.629
When the torrent of energy becomes heat,
you get hot like burning coal.

07:01.712 --> 07:03.923
Next, it'll transform
to an ice-cold chill.

07:04.006 --> 07:06.634
If you bear all that,
the energy will finally become yours.

07:07.885 --> 07:10.179
Slowly. Keep breathing, okay?

07:18.438 --> 07:19.564
Cold water.

07:33.703 --> 07:34.579
Mu-deok.

07:35.496 --> 07:37.081
Is the Young Master still bathing?

07:37.165 --> 07:39.125
It's been almost an hour since he went in.

07:39.709 --> 07:41.752
If she finds out,
she'll tell Songrim.

07:42.336 --> 07:43.921
They'll take the torrent of energy.

07:44.005 --> 07:44.881
Medicine.

07:46.424 --> 07:48.676
He's bathing in water
with herbal medicine.

07:49.510 --> 07:50.970
I put herbal medicine in the water

07:51.554 --> 07:53.890
and let him bathe in it
in order to treat his wounds.

07:55.141 --> 07:55.975
Really?

07:57.351 --> 07:58.603
Good thinking.

08:01.689 --> 08:02.523
Hold on.

08:10.031 --> 08:11.782
Then why are you bringing him cold water?

08:12.366 --> 08:13.326
What?

08:13.409 --> 08:15.870
If he's been bathing for an hour,
the water must be cold.

08:16.454 --> 08:18.039
So why would you bring cold water?

08:20.833 --> 08:22.210
He has a fever?

08:23.628 --> 08:25.129
Young Master.

08:27.340 --> 08:28.216
Damn.

08:30.676 --> 08:31.511
It's cold.

08:32.220 --> 08:33.804
Feel how cold this water is?

08:33.888 --> 08:35.348
Do you want him to catch a cold?

08:42.188 --> 08:44.649
The boiling hot water
has become ice-cold.

08:44.732 --> 08:46.192
Young Master.

08:47.985 --> 08:48.903
Where is he?

08:49.987 --> 08:50.905
Goodness.

08:54.867 --> 08:57.328
Young Master, are you all right?

08:58.037 --> 08:59.247
Yes.

08:59.330 --> 09:02.583
Bathing in the herbal medicine
has made me drowsy.

09:05.378 --> 09:07.755
What are you doing?
Hurry up and make his bed.

09:09.215 --> 09:12.510
It's the chill.
The chill has begun to surge.

09:18.724 --> 09:21.811
I'm freezing. It feels like I'm in ice.

09:22.645 --> 09:26.440
It's the chill surging this time.
It's happening way faster than I thought.

09:27.858 --> 09:28.859
Keep breathing, okay?

09:54.552 --> 09:56.012
I am so cold. I think I might faint.

09:58.389 --> 10:00.308
Fight it. You must fight it.

10:02.685 --> 10:04.228
Jang Uk!

10:04.312 --> 10:05.229
Stay with me.

10:05.313 --> 10:07.857
You will freeze to death
if you fall asleep now. Get up.

10:10.860 --> 10:12.111
Just keep breathing.

10:23.164 --> 10:26.500
Uncle, Yul and I are
the only friends that Uk has.

10:26.584 --> 10:29.170
He has nowhere else but Songrim
to call home.

10:29.253 --> 10:32.298
Please rescind your order
forbidding him to enter.

10:32.381 --> 10:33.758
He won't be able to train.

10:34.258 --> 10:36.093
Once it's known that he was banished,

10:36.177 --> 10:37.928
no one from Songrim will take him in.

10:40.097 --> 10:41.390
Enough talk of Uk.

10:41.891 --> 10:45.227
I want you two to focus
on the Soul Shifter case.

10:54.153 --> 10:56.197
He has completely hardened.

10:57.490 --> 10:58.866
He has been petrified.

11:02.411 --> 11:03.829
A Soul Shifter running wild

11:04.413 --> 11:06.874
replaces their lost energy
by taking a human's.

11:09.293 --> 11:10.920
He's like an evil spirit.

11:11.420 --> 11:14.048
I can see why you forbid
the Alchemy of Souls.

11:14.131 --> 11:17.009
This was not always forbidden sorcery.

11:17.593 --> 11:18.469
You can only perform it

11:18.552 --> 11:22.723
once you've mastered Jipsu, Ryusu,
Chisu, and Hwansu.

11:22.807 --> 11:24.308
Hwansu is godlike power,

11:24.392 --> 11:27.812
changing water to fire
and fire to stone as well.

11:27.895 --> 11:30.106
- I thought no one could achieve that.
- Hmm.

11:30.189 --> 11:33.025
Master Seogyeong, founder of Songrim, did.

11:33.109 --> 11:34.610
And there was someone else as well.

11:34.694 --> 11:35.736
Who's that?

11:35.820 --> 11:37.738
Like you would know, even if I told you!

11:39.198 --> 11:41.784
Who dared to perform the Alchemy of Souls

11:41.867 --> 11:44.620
on this poor pupil?
Who did this to him?

11:44.704 --> 11:47.998
This man was meant to work at Cheonbugwan,
recording constellations.

11:48.499 --> 11:50.751
He had been visiting the place
regularly for the past few months.

11:51.752 --> 11:54.255
Ah! Like they caught Naksu's men,

11:54.338 --> 11:56.757
the ones we failed to catch,
as if they'd been waiting.

11:56.841 --> 11:58.092
I got it!

11:58.175 --> 12:00.344
I bet Cheonbugwan definitely
has something to do

12:00.428 --> 12:01.470
with the Soul Shifter case.

12:03.514 --> 12:06.225
Yul, Dang-gu, keep an eye on Cheonbugwan.

12:06.308 --> 12:08.144
See if there's anything strange.
Understand?

12:08.978 --> 12:10.187
Sir.

12:12.189 --> 12:13.023
What's wrong?

12:13.691 --> 12:16.068
It does that quite often
since Uk broke it.

12:17.111 --> 12:18.779
- Jang Uk, this--
- Do not move!

12:19.905 --> 12:20.740
It'll crumble.

12:24.702 --> 12:25.786
Do not move,

12:26.454 --> 12:28.164
until the door shuts completely!

12:29.165 --> 12:30.583
Jang Uk!

12:30.666 --> 12:32.668
I told you not to move!

12:32.752 --> 12:35.171
Damn you! I told you!

12:37.423 --> 12:39.383
Calm down. You.

12:39.925 --> 12:40.968
Jang Uk!

13:12.291 --> 13:13.959
Stay down for a moment.

13:33.062 --> 13:34.021
Sapsali.

13:35.022 --> 13:36.023
Come on out.

13:36.899 --> 13:38.484
You are now coming with me.

14:23.112 --> 14:24.780
You have done very well, my friend.

14:28.742 --> 14:32.580
If you find the Soul Shifters,
I'll reward you with treats.

14:33.330 --> 14:34.415
I hope we get along.

15:04.778 --> 15:05.654
Mu-deok.

15:07.865 --> 15:09.158
If I freeze to death,

15:11.076 --> 15:12.578
take the torrent of energy…

15:15.039 --> 15:16.874
from within me if you can.

15:18.250 --> 15:20.711
If I could do that,
I would already have killed you.

15:24.214 --> 15:25.633
I'm freezing to death here…

15:27.217 --> 15:29.345
please don't say such cold things now.

15:31.388 --> 15:32.806
Say something heartwarming.

15:33.390 --> 15:35.559
Have you gone mad from the energy surging?

15:35.643 --> 15:36.852
What's with you?

15:41.690 --> 15:43.776
Jang Uk! Wake up.

15:44.485 --> 15:47.488
All right, fine then.
I'll say something warm.

15:50.324 --> 15:53.786
There was a huge tree
back where I used to live.

15:55.871 --> 15:59.249
And there was a bird's nest
right up at the top of it.

15:59.333 --> 16:01.001
The egg inside, it was warm.

16:02.753 --> 16:03.754
Did you eat it?

16:04.964 --> 16:06.632
I said this would be heartwarming.

16:12.429 --> 16:14.932
The mother bird used to always come by
to sit on it.

16:19.561 --> 16:20.604
Right now, I am…

16:21.438 --> 16:23.899
the egg in that bird's nest
at the top of the tree.

16:27.403 --> 16:28.696
I know no one.

16:30.990 --> 16:32.533
And I cannot know anything.

16:36.870 --> 16:39.289
You're the only person
who can take care of me.

16:43.502 --> 16:44.670
And right now…

16:45.963 --> 16:47.798
I'm holding on to that one person.

16:55.305 --> 16:56.557
How heartwarming.

17:03.022 --> 17:04.231
Please keep going.

17:08.569 --> 17:11.447
There was also a small cave
nearby where I used to live.

17:13.824 --> 17:15.701
And there was a bear cub inside.

17:47.357 --> 17:49.318
How can you expect
to learn how to cast any spells,

17:49.401 --> 17:51.320
when you can't even unsheathe
your father's sword?

17:53.072 --> 17:55.574
There is no mage in Daeho
that would go against your father

17:55.657 --> 17:57.743
and dare to open
your gate of energy for you.

17:57.826 --> 18:00.537
That is the fate that your father…

18:01.538 --> 18:03.207
has determined for you.

18:24.561 --> 18:25.729
You're not ready just yet.

18:31.944 --> 18:34.488
To unsheathe a sword
imbued with the energy of a mage,

18:35.114 --> 18:38.200
you must master Ryusu and be able
to channel your energy outward.

18:38.909 --> 18:41.120
Since you cannot yet surge
the energy within,

18:41.203 --> 18:42.287
you can't unsheathe it.

18:42.955 --> 18:45.833
This is the sword
my so-called father left behind.

18:45.916 --> 18:48.127
I can only join Songrim
if I'm able to unsheathe it.

18:50.963 --> 18:52.881
I want to unsheathe it and show them all.

18:54.258 --> 18:55.092
Am I full of it?

18:55.592 --> 18:56.885
Of spirit.

18:59.138 --> 19:02.015
Carry it with you, Jang Uk.

19:21.243 --> 19:23.662
Your Highness, we've arrived
at the house of Jang Gang,

19:23.745 --> 19:24.746
Gwanju of Cheobugwan.

19:29.168 --> 19:30.210
Young Master!

19:32.337 --> 19:34.715
There is-- Forgive me,
but you have a guest.

19:35.424 --> 19:36.341
Who is it?

19:36.425 --> 19:39.678
It's the Crown Prince. He's come
from the Royal Palace to see you.

20:02.117 --> 20:04.620
This is the perfect weather

20:04.703 --> 20:08.123
to go fishing with Uk
at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

20:10.375 --> 20:12.920
I wonder if he's recovered
from the flogging.

20:14.504 --> 20:16.673
I'm going to see him
because I'm quite worried right now.

20:17.257 --> 20:18.425
But why are you tagging along?

20:19.927 --> 20:21.220
To check something.

20:21.303 --> 20:23.347
There is something I said to his servant.

20:23.430 --> 20:26.516
Hmm. Well, that… I understand.

20:26.600 --> 20:28.727
We're his good friends.
But why are you tagging along?

20:29.853 --> 20:31.980
I just happened to run into you.

20:32.064 --> 20:34.524
And I happened to have
a bone to pick with him.

20:34.608 --> 20:35.734
So that's why I'm going.

20:35.817 --> 20:38.278
Ah, so you're going to fight with him.

20:38.946 --> 20:40.489
What do you have in that bundle?

20:43.867 --> 20:45.452
Medicine for his wounds.

20:46.078 --> 20:49.873
Oh, you're going to fight with him,
and then give him medicine.

20:51.041 --> 20:53.460
I see. Incredible.

20:55.420 --> 20:57.589
So, you've come for Naksu's sword,
Your Highness?

20:57.673 --> 20:59.508
The King's entrusted it to Cheonbugwan.

21:00.175 --> 21:03.345
The Gwanju is gone, so Assistant Gwanju,
Jin Mu should take it.

21:07.474 --> 21:10.435
Since you have come here yourself,
I shall return it.

21:10.519 --> 21:11.520
You may take it back.

21:11.603 --> 21:12.980
Bring it here.

21:14.856 --> 21:15.691
One more thing.

21:16.650 --> 21:19.027
There's another sword here
which you cannot unsheathe.

21:20.696 --> 21:24.199
The late king Seon bestowed it
on the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan, Jang Gang.

21:24.908 --> 21:26.326
I will take that one as well.

21:26.410 --> 21:29.454
That sword belongs
to Young Master's father, Your Highness.

21:30.080 --> 21:31.707
It's only right that his son keeps it.

21:31.790 --> 21:33.333
It was never given to him to begin with.

21:34.710 --> 21:36.920
I heard it was being kept in Songrim.

21:37.004 --> 21:39.923
And you only took it
after you were banished, did you not?

21:41.633 --> 21:45.053
The Royal Palace will keep it
until a new Gwanju has been instated.

21:47.055 --> 21:48.098
Bring me the sword.

21:55.522 --> 21:56.940
I cannot do that, Your Highness.

21:59.151 --> 22:02.404
As you already know,
no one acknowledges him as my father.

22:04.072 --> 22:06.491
It'll not bode well for me
to lose the sword as well.

22:07.701 --> 22:10.287
Even merely as decoration, I'll keep it.

22:13.915 --> 22:15.876
I must take it with me when I leave.

22:16.710 --> 22:18.920
Since you refuse, I have no other choice.

22:21.423 --> 22:23.008
Whoever wins shall take it.

22:41.068 --> 22:42.861
It's not fair to challenge you
to a real fight

22:42.944 --> 22:44.279
when you're not fully trained.

22:50.577 --> 22:52.662
So, if you can push me over this line,

22:53.330 --> 22:54.623
I will leave you the sword.

23:09.429 --> 23:12.682
I'm sure, Your Highness,
that you have been expecting me

23:12.766 --> 23:13.975
to grovel in humiliation.

23:15.310 --> 23:18.647
I would have to be full of it to think
that I can compete with you right now.

23:18.730 --> 23:21.441
However, some would call that spirit,

23:21.525 --> 23:22.484
so I'll try my best.

24:15.871 --> 24:17.205
Energy's surging.

24:17.289 --> 24:18.582
Because of the flogging.

24:18.665 --> 24:20.709
The flogging caused
the energy to surge faster.

24:21.585 --> 24:23.170
Good thing you were flogged, Jang Uk.

24:23.253 --> 24:26.131
All right.
Show me what you've got.

25:46.211 --> 25:47.337
Watch out!

25:47.963 --> 25:49.089
This is from the chamber pots!

26:02.602 --> 26:03.645
What's the meaning of this?

26:05.063 --> 26:05.939
Who is she?

26:07.274 --> 26:10.193
- I'm the Young Master's servant.
- How dare a servant intervene?

26:13.905 --> 26:15.323
My apologies, Your Highness.

26:15.407 --> 26:17.075
My servant was being insolent.

26:19.744 --> 26:20.579
What is this?

26:23.373 --> 26:25.834
Argh! Get it off me!

26:25.917 --> 26:27.335
You should return and get changed.

26:28.336 --> 26:30.589
- What?
- You stepped over the line you drew.

26:34.175 --> 26:36.595
You may have stepped back
to avoid the filthy water.

26:36.678 --> 26:38.847
But it is still your loss,
Your Royal Highness.

26:39.347 --> 26:41.308
Please go, and leave
Jang Gang's sword behind.

26:42.309 --> 26:43.852
As you can see,

26:43.935 --> 26:46.479
I'm injured, so I'm afraid
I will not be able to see you out.

26:50.567 --> 26:51.526
Oh.

26:54.195 --> 26:55.405
What's going on?

26:56.489 --> 26:57.699
All right.

26:57.782 --> 26:59.618
I will keep my promise
and let you have it.

27:00.327 --> 27:01.328
However…

27:02.495 --> 27:03.955
you know the girl must be punished.

27:09.419 --> 27:11.755
A servant must not dirty
the clothes of a Crown Prince.

28:04.641 --> 28:07.185
I-I unsheathed this sword.

28:21.241 --> 28:22.075
Jang Uk!

28:23.576 --> 28:25.245
I thought your gate of energy was blocked,

28:25.787 --> 28:27.455
but you have been deceiving us all.

28:30.583 --> 28:31.501
What's this?

28:39.175 --> 28:40.009
You!

28:41.010 --> 28:43.054
How dare you point
a sword at the Crown Prince?

28:43.138 --> 28:44.723
- No, it's not me--
- Uk! Drop it!

28:45.724 --> 28:47.934
- Put the sword down!
- I'm trying to!

28:48.518 --> 28:50.520
I swear, but I can't!

29:12.917 --> 29:14.043
Stop it! What are you doing?

29:15.879 --> 29:17.213
I told you I'm not--

29:29.684 --> 29:30.602
Jang Uk.

29:31.686 --> 29:32.937
Die!

29:42.822 --> 29:43.865
Please stop this.

29:49.871 --> 29:50.955
Oh.

29:52.457 --> 29:54.334
- Stop this!
- I can't control my arm.

29:57.796 --> 29:59.172
I-I didn't mean that!

29:59.672 --> 30:02.091
Young Master, Young Master,
Young-- Ah!

30:09.057 --> 30:10.975
It's a binding bracelet,
over a hundred geun,

30:11.059 --> 30:12.727
your arm won't be able to move.

30:18.733 --> 30:20.401
His energy
couldn't surge properly.

30:20.485 --> 30:22.779
It overflowed into one arm
and he lost control.

30:24.489 --> 30:25.657
Unbind him now!

30:28.201 --> 30:29.160
Jang Uk.

30:30.245 --> 30:31.454
Take up your sword.

30:33.665 --> 30:34.624
Your Highness.

30:34.707 --> 30:36.709
Please, Jang Uk is no match
for your skills.

30:36.793 --> 30:37.877
Did you not see it?

30:38.461 --> 30:41.005
He unsheathed his father's sword
and pointed it at me.

30:41.089 --> 30:43.550
Uk could not control his energy.
It's just him making a mistake.

30:43.633 --> 30:46.219
- As you saw, he even hit me as well--
- Stay out of it!

30:48.221 --> 30:50.807
Your Highness, it was you
who drew your sword first.

30:51.391 --> 30:53.434
If the sword you wielded
in anger was broken,

30:53.518 --> 30:55.937
you should abide by the customs
and return home.

30:59.065 --> 31:01.943
So you all dare stand
against the Crown Prince.

31:04.445 --> 31:07.574
Jang, Park, Jin, and Seo.
All four families.

31:08.992 --> 31:11.619
I refuse to return defeated like this.

31:11.703 --> 31:12.787
What will you do?

31:14.122 --> 31:16.708
Fight together,
all four families against me?

31:23.882 --> 31:26.551
Uh, this looks bad.

31:27.135 --> 31:29.637
All four families
against the Royal family.

31:30.221 --> 31:31.639
This is getting pretty serious.

31:31.723 --> 31:33.308
Cho-yeon provoked him too much.

31:33.391 --> 31:34.976
Me? What did I do?

31:35.602 --> 31:38.438
Fine, just hand Uk over.

31:38.521 --> 31:39.522
Your Highness,

31:40.481 --> 31:42.734
they are the heirs
of the four great families of Daeho.

31:43.318 --> 31:44.777
If His Majesty hears of this,

31:44.861 --> 31:46.029
he will be furious.

31:48.197 --> 31:50.199
Well, what should I do?
Just leave like this?

31:51.576 --> 31:53.119
Why didn't you stop me earlier?

32:07.800 --> 32:08.676
Mu-deok, you…

32:17.143 --> 32:18.811
I've committed a crime worthy of death.

32:20.188 --> 32:23.358
This lowly servant
dared to splash filthy chamber pot water

32:23.441 --> 32:24.525
on His Royal Highness.

32:29.614 --> 32:31.991
I'm sorry.
It's a crime worthy of death.

32:32.075 --> 32:33.201
Get away!

32:33.868 --> 32:35.578
Go. You reek. Go!

32:36.704 --> 32:38.957
Please, please forgive me.

32:42.710 --> 32:48.549
As a token of my apology,
I will drink the rest of this water.

32:48.633 --> 32:50.760
So please, forgive me.

33:00.812 --> 33:01.688
Mu-deok!

33:04.023 --> 33:06.150
Why on earth would you drink that, huh?

33:09.028 --> 33:09.862
Young Master!

33:13.282 --> 33:14.909
I should be the one drinking it.

33:16.536 --> 33:17.870
What?

33:19.747 --> 33:21.249
Uh, no.

33:21.332 --> 33:23.167
Why would you drink it, Young Master?

33:23.251 --> 33:25.670
I'm the cause of all this,
so I should drink it.

33:25.753 --> 33:29.007
No, it's because of me
that His Royal Highness is angry.

33:29.090 --> 33:30.800
So I ought to drink it.

33:34.429 --> 33:36.431
But, there's quite a bit.

33:37.265 --> 33:39.934
So, just give it to me then,
and I'll drink it.

33:40.018 --> 33:41.144
How about we each drink half?

33:42.478 --> 33:44.689
Why would we share this water
like it's something good?

33:44.772 --> 33:45.690
Huh?

33:46.691 --> 33:47.859
Here, you can have it.

33:48.860 --> 33:51.487
I'll drink
as much as I can and leave you the rest.

33:52.238 --> 33:54.365
I can't use my arm with these beads
so help me hold it.

33:57.452 --> 33:59.203
Young Master!

34:04.042 --> 34:06.544
I will drink! I will--

34:06.627 --> 34:08.087
Huh?

34:08.671 --> 34:09.630
It's fine.

34:09.714 --> 34:11.591
Why should you have to drink this?
Just go!

34:13.468 --> 34:15.136
Just how much is there?

34:15.219 --> 34:16.763
I should drink some, too, huh?

34:17.472 --> 34:19.348
- Really?
- Yeah, give it to me.

34:23.436 --> 34:25.354
It really is--

34:28.066 --> 34:29.108
Your Highness.

34:29.192 --> 34:31.194
How could we have the audacity
to challenge you?

34:32.320 --> 34:35.656
Must they really drink
that chamber pot water as an apology?

34:41.537 --> 34:44.749
Just forget it.
I can't watch this anymore.

34:47.210 --> 34:48.294
Let's go.

34:50.129 --> 34:53.341
His Royal Highness is leaving!
Bow before him!

34:59.222 --> 35:01.599
But, why was the Crown Prince here
in the first place?

35:02.308 --> 35:04.268
He came to get Naksu's sword.

35:04.894 --> 35:06.896
And he suddenly picked a fight
with Young Master.

35:07.563 --> 35:10.316
I mean, he may have just left for today,
but with that temper,

35:10.817 --> 35:12.110
there's more trouble ahead.

35:16.072 --> 35:18.449
- Are you all right?
- He hit me so many times.

35:19.909 --> 35:21.536
Hey,
you hurt me back there, too.

35:23.496 --> 35:25.206
- Are you all right?
- Yeah, I'm fine.

35:25.289 --> 35:27.208
Oh, it hurts right there?

35:27.291 --> 35:29.043
It hurts. Why would you…

35:29.127 --> 35:30.628
Stop that, Young Master?

35:33.756 --> 35:36.050
Your Highness! Your Highness!

35:41.055 --> 35:42.473
What's this?

35:42.557 --> 35:45.560
You said you came here for Naksu's sword,
and so I brought it to you.

35:47.603 --> 35:48.437
Right.

35:49.355 --> 35:50.898
I did come to retrieve that.

35:50.982 --> 35:54.735
I brought it because someone as important
as you shouldn't have to come back for it.

35:54.819 --> 35:56.195
Please take it.

35:57.029 --> 36:00.324
So, what you'd like me to do
is to take it and never return?

36:00.908 --> 36:05.621
Mm, Your Royal Highness
is so very intelligent and strong.

36:05.705 --> 36:07.915
You're teasing me
because I lost to your master?

36:07.999 --> 36:10.835
You lost? Your Highness is taking
what you came here for.

36:11.419 --> 36:12.920
My Young Master is losing it to you.

36:13.004 --> 36:16.007
It seems, instead,
that you are the winner here.

36:18.426 --> 36:22.096
The young lady is correct.
Your Royal Highness has won.

36:22.930 --> 36:25.308
Congratulations.

36:27.393 --> 36:28.519
Let's say it's true.

36:31.981 --> 36:34.734
Ah! You are truly so generous as well.

36:34.817 --> 36:37.695
There is no other man
who is as noble as you.

36:42.575 --> 36:43.409
What is your name?

36:45.703 --> 36:47.163
Mu-deok, Your Highness.

36:48.414 --> 36:49.248
Mu-deok.

36:50.333 --> 36:53.377
Since you threw filth at me,
I'll call you Filthy Mu-deok.

36:54.128 --> 36:58.007
Just like your name,
you reek of filth right now.

37:04.388 --> 37:06.390
You even gave me a nickname.

37:06.474 --> 37:10.102
I, Filthy Mu-deok, forever am grateful
for your kindness.

37:14.357 --> 37:15.733
Goodbye, Your Highness.

37:17.902 --> 37:18.778
Let's go.

37:27.870 --> 37:30.539
My pupil is still too weak
to fight you.

37:31.374 --> 37:34.710
Until he is ready,
I cannot let him be at odds with you.

37:42.260 --> 37:44.720
You don't hesitate to fall in love
or grovel

37:45.221 --> 37:46.514
for your master's sake.

37:46.597 --> 37:49.100
I am too weak to fight him myself,
so I did what I could.

37:51.185 --> 37:54.063
And now I reek of filth.
You should avoid me too.

38:00.152 --> 38:00.987
Here.

38:04.949 --> 38:07.326
How could I possibly dirty
the man I'm in love with?

38:08.327 --> 38:09.412
No, thank you.

38:44.822 --> 38:47.575
Ugh, I really am Filthy Mu-deok.

38:53.539 --> 38:56.417
You should wash yourself.
You probably reek too.

39:14.143 --> 39:16.479
Master, I finally did it.

39:42.797 --> 39:46.634
The Gwigu that was stored
at Jinyowon has been stolen recently.

39:48.094 --> 39:51.847
No one outside of the Jin family
can open the door to Jinyowon.

39:52.807 --> 39:55.810
They must have summoned the Gwigu
to get it out of there.

39:57.520 --> 39:58.938
A burglary at Jinyowon?

39:59.522 --> 40:02.775
I suppose since the devastation
of losing your eldest daughter,

40:02.858 --> 40:05.653
your energy must not be the same
as it was before.

40:06.695 --> 40:08.989
You impudent bastard.

40:09.573 --> 40:13.035
You may be illegitimate,
but you're still part of the Jin family.

40:13.119 --> 40:15.204
How dare you speak
to your sister like that?

40:15.287 --> 40:16.414
How dare you?

40:16.497 --> 40:17.790
I'm the Assistant Gwanju now

40:17.873 --> 40:20.501
and I'd appreciate it
if you showed me more respect.

40:28.509 --> 40:31.720
My Lord, please come outside.
Jang Uk is here.

40:53.159 --> 40:55.161
I have forbidden Jang Uk
from entering.

40:55.244 --> 40:58.789
So why are you all here,
marching in behind him now?

40:59.874 --> 41:01.500
There is something I wish to show you.

41:08.799 --> 41:10.593
This is the sword of my father.

41:11.385 --> 41:12.511
When I was a child,

41:12.595 --> 41:14.763
you said if I could unsheathe it,
you would accept me.

41:15.514 --> 41:16.390
Do you remember?

41:57.348 --> 42:00.059
I thought his gate of energy
had just opened recently.

42:00.684 --> 42:04.355
He-- he has absorbed my torrent of energy!

42:04.438 --> 42:06.106
Like father, like son.

42:07.107 --> 42:08.734
He mastered Ryusu at once.

42:09.693 --> 42:12.613
My Lord, please accept me now

42:13.447 --> 42:14.448
into Songrim.

42:19.370 --> 42:20.913
What is that thing around your arm?

42:21.497 --> 42:23.749
His energy is focused in his right arm.

42:24.250 --> 42:27.169
He can't control it yet,
so it's tied with a binding bracelet.

42:39.265 --> 42:40.724
Remove the binding bracelet.

42:41.642 --> 42:43.852
If we remove it now,
his arm will be out of control.

42:44.353 --> 42:47.106
He needs to receive some more training
before he can remove it safely.

42:48.315 --> 42:49.275
Remove it now.

43:15.843 --> 43:19.096
Let me see how well you hold that sword.

43:50.586 --> 43:51.712
Put the bracelet on.

44:05.559 --> 44:07.936
Are you-- are you all right?

44:08.896 --> 44:10.814
What's the point of unsheathing the sword…

44:12.983 --> 44:14.526
when you cannot even wield it?

44:20.532 --> 44:22.701
He is unable
to control it for now.

44:22.785 --> 44:24.453
But Jang Uk's power is incredible.

44:25.037 --> 44:26.538
He even defeated the Crown Prince.

44:27.247 --> 44:29.958
Jang Uk broke
His Royal Highness's sword in one stroke.

44:30.042 --> 44:32.586
Even the Prince
who mastered Ryusu long ago

44:32.670 --> 44:33.796
lost to him.

44:35.673 --> 44:37.966
Jin Cho-yeon, stop intervening.

44:39.218 --> 44:40.511
Yes, Mother.

44:41.637 --> 44:46.141
Uk, did you take up arms
against the Crown Prince?

44:46.725 --> 44:48.477
Uk was not the first to start the fight.

44:48.560 --> 44:50.437
Did you fight against the Crown Prince?

44:52.648 --> 44:53.482
Yes.

44:54.858 --> 44:57.486
His Royal Highness wanted
to take the Gwanju's sword.

44:57.569 --> 44:59.530
So the two of them made a bet, my Lord.

45:00.155 --> 45:02.116
Even the Crown Prince
forgave him.

45:03.325 --> 45:04.702
After breaking the Prince's sword,

45:04.785 --> 45:06.787
Uk threatened him
with a sword he can't control.

45:07.830 --> 45:10.624
He chose to put
the Crown Prince's life in danger.

45:10.708 --> 45:11.709
We were all there with him.

45:12.835 --> 45:13.919
We were able to stop him.

45:14.002 --> 45:15.963
Meaning that the four of you
simply watched

45:16.046 --> 45:18.298
and did nothing
as His Royal Highness was ridiculed.

45:20.676 --> 45:23.762
This is an insult to the royal family!

45:26.849 --> 45:28.559
Lock up Jang Uk.

45:31.437 --> 45:33.605
He's a dangerous man
with a sword he can't control at all.

45:33.689 --> 45:34.815
Yes, my lord.

45:54.418 --> 45:56.295
As soon as his gate of energy was opened,

45:56.378 --> 46:00.215
Jang Uk immediately drew his sword
at the Crown Prince.

46:03.552 --> 46:06.054
Cheonbugwan is not going
to take this lightly.

47:06.198 --> 47:07.825
Why haven't you received
any treatment yet?

47:07.908 --> 47:09.326
You bled a lot back there.

47:11.370 --> 47:13.247
Your arm, is it all right?

47:17.543 --> 47:19.753
The weight of the bracelet
makes it difficult to move it.

47:20.587 --> 47:21.672
But I'm all right for now.

47:23.340 --> 47:26.510
You managed to make Master Heo's
torrent of energy yours

47:26.593 --> 47:28.095
in a short period of time.

47:29.429 --> 47:30.472
I'm very impressed.

47:33.350 --> 47:35.018
It felt like my body was on fire.

47:35.686 --> 47:38.146
But then after that,
it felt like I was covered in ice.

47:39.982 --> 47:41.316
And your flogging wounds?

47:42.150 --> 47:43.151
Are they all right?

47:46.405 --> 47:50.450
It seems that the flogging
helped the energy to surge much faster.

47:52.411 --> 47:54.454
The Prince beat me quite a bit too.

47:55.747 --> 47:59.626
- Mm.
- Then I felt a surge within myself, so…

47:59.710 --> 48:01.003
I unsheathed the sword.

48:03.463 --> 48:04.381
Right.

48:05.299 --> 48:09.636
You always were a quick learner
compared to the other children.

48:10.804 --> 48:14.308
You even learned
to walk and run sooner than Dang-gu did.

48:15.434 --> 48:17.644
You were even talking earlier.

48:19.062 --> 48:20.564
Yes, I remember that as well.

48:21.189 --> 48:24.735
So, when I was young, before I knew
what a blocked gate of energy was,

48:26.528 --> 48:28.697
I thought I'd be
the most powerful person in the world.

48:34.328 --> 48:35.162
Uk.

48:37.039 --> 48:40.417
Since you are so intelligent,
and such a quick learner…

48:43.420 --> 48:47.633
Why don't you join our trade at Songrim?
You could learn how to do business here.

48:48.216 --> 48:52.971
Or you could learn the art of medicine
under Master Heo.

48:58.018 --> 48:59.144
I can't.

49:02.022 --> 49:05.025
I am going to train at Jeongjingak
and become a powerful mage.

49:05.692 --> 49:06.568
Why?

49:07.903 --> 49:10.447
Because you have to do the same thing
that your father did?

49:12.532 --> 49:15.535
Do you want to become
the next Gwanju of Cheonbugwan after him?

49:16.286 --> 49:18.956
Yes. And I will be.

49:20.290 --> 49:21.750
I'll take his place,

49:21.833 --> 49:24.878
and I'll prove myself
to all the scumbags who say…

49:26.296 --> 49:27.381
that I'm not his son.

49:27.464 --> 49:28.298
You…

49:30.676 --> 49:31.927
will never be…

49:33.428 --> 49:34.346
his son.

49:37.766 --> 49:38.976
You are…

49:40.102 --> 49:42.896
the child of an affair
had by your mother Do-hwa.

49:45.732 --> 49:48.777
You're allowed into the Jang family
out of respect for your late mother,

49:48.860 --> 49:51.238
but we cannot allow you
to lead Cheonbugwan after your father.

49:51.321 --> 49:54.241
So you can stop dreaming
because you'll never become anything…

49:57.577 --> 49:58.453
like your father.

50:00.163 --> 50:02.499
Just continue to remain the Young Master…

50:04.042 --> 50:06.294
of the Jang family
who doesn't know anything.

50:08.380 --> 50:09.256
If you do…

50:11.591 --> 50:13.260
we can continue to take care of you.

50:21.018 --> 50:21.852
Wait.

50:25.439 --> 50:26.898
Who is my real father, then?

50:29.776 --> 50:33.447
How could anyone know
who your late mother…

50:36.366 --> 50:37.868
had an affair with?

51:12.444 --> 51:14.571
Uk must have a lot on his mind right now.

51:14.654 --> 51:16.198
You should let him be.

51:22.913 --> 51:24.790
Make sure he still finishes his food.

51:34.591 --> 51:37.177
Maid Kim told me to make sure
you finished your whole meal.

51:41.223 --> 51:42.432
Did he scold you?

51:44.935 --> 51:47.062
I thought you were used to
being scolded by the…

51:59.825 --> 52:00.909
I did not do that.

52:01.493 --> 52:04.371
I think they have yet to fix the door
that you broke last time.

52:06.998 --> 52:07.916
Do not move.

52:09.709 --> 52:10.961
Just stay there.

52:14.965 --> 52:16.758
Everything could crumble, so…

52:19.511 --> 52:20.762
just stay there.

52:34.067 --> 52:36.236
Why did you not even attempt
to avoid his blade?

52:37.779 --> 52:41.783
Was it so you could have a reason
to banish him again?

52:42.909 --> 52:44.411
It was the least I could do.

52:44.995 --> 52:48.498
After all, I was the one
who just broke his heart.

52:50.250 --> 52:54.254
Having to break his heart
must be more painful than being stabbed.

52:56.298 --> 52:57.257
Maid Kim.

52:58.091 --> 53:00.260
You said before that

53:01.011 --> 53:03.638
there were rumors
about me being Uk's father.

53:03.722 --> 53:05.557
Well, what if I were to say that

53:06.308 --> 53:10.395
that I was indeed his father to everyone?

53:14.274 --> 53:16.276
I'd step down from my position, and…

53:18.111 --> 53:20.280
I would open up
a little business of my own.

53:21.823 --> 53:23.700
Then I could go about trading with Uk.

53:24.284 --> 53:26.953
What about Songrim?
What would they do without you?

53:29.080 --> 53:30.540
It would be even better

53:31.625 --> 53:33.668
if I were to say he was my child.

53:34.377 --> 53:35.587
Then Uk and I

53:35.670 --> 53:39.049
could just go and live in the small town
where I grew up with Lady Do-hwa.

53:41.635 --> 53:44.346
Now that is impossible.

53:45.055 --> 53:45.889
Hmm?

53:46.473 --> 53:48.600
You know Uk takes after Do-hwa.

53:49.392 --> 53:50.477
That's why…

53:51.686 --> 53:53.480
he's so good-looking.

53:54.981 --> 53:56.107
Who would believe…

53:58.568 --> 54:00.070
…that you were the mother of Jang Uk?

54:02.280 --> 54:03.281
Wait a minute.

54:04.074 --> 54:07.911
You're saying, if he were to resemble me,
he would be ugly?

54:09.120 --> 54:11.289
Then, you can't say
you are his father, either.

54:11.373 --> 54:12.874
Of course, I can.

54:13.541 --> 54:16.086
Jang Gang and I
have always been neck and neck…

54:20.507 --> 54:22.592
…when it came to our looks.

54:24.886 --> 54:27.013
No, you lost.

54:27.597 --> 54:29.140
You can't hold a candle to him.

54:29.224 --> 54:33.270
Do-hwa said she loved everything
about you except for your looks.

54:33.353 --> 54:35.021
Stop it! You're just making that up!

54:36.815 --> 54:38.566
You didn't flinch when you got stabbed,

54:38.650 --> 54:40.610
but I guess
hearing you're ugly hurts more.

54:41.111 --> 54:42.279
My wound…

54:44.072 --> 54:45.490
it actually does hurt.

54:45.991 --> 54:47.909
Oh, dear. Does it really hurt?

54:47.993 --> 54:50.370
Oh, stay still.
You're going to reopen your wound.

54:52.414 --> 54:53.456
We share…

54:55.750 --> 54:57.794
the exact same kind of pain…

54:59.796 --> 55:01.589
not having our feelings reciprocated

55:02.549 --> 55:04.884
by the ones we loved the most.

55:05.468 --> 55:06.303
So…

55:07.804 --> 55:09.055
let's not hurt each other.

55:11.099 --> 55:14.436
All right, I admit that I made that up.

55:14.519 --> 55:15.812
You are…

55:17.022 --> 55:19.024
…good…

55:20.734 --> 55:22.902
…good…

55:24.571 --> 55:26.072
You are good-looking.

55:28.533 --> 55:31.244
And you are also indeed…

55:36.374 --> 55:38.960
…good-looking.

55:47.135 --> 55:49.929
Let me continue tending to your wound.

55:50.597 --> 55:51.639
It really hurts.

55:55.393 --> 55:56.895
A-a bit lower.

55:57.479 --> 55:59.272
Yep. Yeah--

56:01.107 --> 56:02.067
Goodness.

56:10.158 --> 56:11.576
The Spirit Plaque from Chwiseonru

56:11.659 --> 56:13.661
belongs to Jang Uk of the Jang family.

56:15.080 --> 56:15.955
Jang Uk?

56:16.039 --> 56:18.833
He was flogged recently
for losing Songrim's Spirit Plaque.

56:18.917 --> 56:22.670
And I hear that his servant would be seen
at Chwiseonru quite frequently.

56:25.632 --> 56:28.468
That girl we saw at Songrim
is his servant.

56:29.719 --> 56:31.846
And she was at the inn that day.

56:35.266 --> 56:36.267
Could she be…

56:37.435 --> 56:38.520
Naksu?

56:42.565 --> 56:45.652
How much further to Cheonbugwan?

56:49.072 --> 56:52.617
It won't be long until I'm petrified.

56:53.368 --> 56:55.036
We will hurry. Please hold on.

56:55.745 --> 56:57.580
You must not run wild right now.

56:58.790 --> 57:01.042
My Lord, are you all right?

57:29.112 --> 57:31.573
Let us return.

57:52.343 --> 57:56.848
In that short period of time,
even if it was only one arm,

57:56.931 --> 57:59.893
you reached Ryusu, huh?

58:00.810 --> 58:04.022
You truly are the son
of the incredible Jang Gang.

58:06.399 --> 58:08.359
Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan

58:08.443 --> 58:09.861
only picked a fight because he knew

58:09.944 --> 58:11.738
that he would never become
the next Gwanju.

58:12.530 --> 58:14.157
He realized that you,

58:14.240 --> 58:17.702
the eldest son of the Jang family,
will become the next Gwanju, you know.

58:26.252 --> 58:28.379
My uncle's wound is not that deep.

58:29.297 --> 58:30.757
Nothing to worry about.

58:30.840 --> 58:35.345
About Jin Mu, don't worry,
I will have a word with him, all right?

58:39.349 --> 58:42.977
- Hmm. All right, all right.
- Please take good care of him.

59:11.422 --> 59:13.383
You always put Uk in danger.

59:15.051 --> 59:17.637
First the poison, and then
the incident with the Prince.

59:18.388 --> 59:19.639
You're always involved.

59:21.849 --> 59:25.436
So, are you saying that
you would like to separate me from him?

59:25.520 --> 59:26.729
No, I cannot do that.

59:30.066 --> 59:32.193
Because every time that
he got what he wanted,

59:33.152 --> 59:34.696
you risked your life to help him.

59:41.536 --> 59:43.246
This is Uk's father's sword.

59:43.830 --> 59:45.039
Take it with you.

01:00:13.568 --> 01:00:15.445
I'm not gonna tolerate this.

01:00:15.528 --> 01:00:17.280
How much longer
are you going to be this way?

01:00:24.245 --> 01:00:25.204
Get up!

01:00:37.884 --> 01:00:40.887
You received a powerful torrent of energy
and managed to surge it.

01:00:41.554 --> 01:00:45.433
It took you merely ten days
when it would have taken others ten years.

01:00:45.516 --> 01:00:47.018
If you continue your training--

01:00:47.101 --> 01:00:48.728
Leave me alone, okay?

01:00:52.023 --> 01:00:53.733
Is this because
of something Park Jin said?

01:00:54.400 --> 01:00:56.569
What you said
about spirit was just talk.

01:00:56.653 --> 01:00:58.446
How can you be this pathetic
to be discouraged

01:00:58.529 --> 01:00:59.530
by just a few stupid words?

01:00:59.614 --> 01:01:02.659
Of course I'm discouraged
that I'm not going to do this anymore.

01:01:02.742 --> 01:01:03.951
So, just shut up, damn it!

01:01:06.079 --> 01:01:07.372
Don't bother me.

01:01:15.129 --> 01:01:17.423
I have no need for a pupil
who won't do anything.

01:01:21.844 --> 01:01:23.262
Then don't be my master.

01:01:24.555 --> 01:01:25.890
Just be my servant.

01:01:27.225 --> 01:01:28.893
I'll sell you if you annoy me.

01:02:08.057 --> 01:02:08.933
Young Master.

01:02:11.477 --> 01:02:16.107
My Young Master is so troubled
that he will not even drink water.

01:02:16.190 --> 01:02:18.151
Young Master Dang-gu, please help me.

01:02:18.234 --> 01:02:19.736
But what can I do, though?

01:02:20.486 --> 01:02:22.321
It's better to just wait
until my uncle resolves this.

01:02:22.405 --> 01:02:25.074
No, but Master Heo said
that he would resolve this.

01:02:25.825 --> 01:02:29.454
Please ask him to meet with Jin Mu
immediately and put an end to this.

01:02:34.125 --> 01:02:37.712
I came here today
because I am somewhat concerned

01:02:37.795 --> 01:02:41.382
that you may have made
a mountain out of a molehill.

01:02:41.466 --> 01:02:43.634
Tell me, how could a threat
to the Crown Prince,

01:02:43.718 --> 01:02:45.845
the future king, be deemed trivial?

01:02:48.389 --> 01:02:52.101
That is why our leader decided
to lock Jang Uk away.

01:02:52.185 --> 01:02:54.937
Songrim will give him
the punishment he needs.

01:02:55.021 --> 01:02:57.774
You realize it is a crime
against the royal family.

01:02:58.483 --> 01:03:01.444
Cheonbugwan is in charge
of matters related to the royal family,

01:03:01.527 --> 01:03:02.987
so we'll deal with him here.

01:03:03.070 --> 01:03:05.198
But what will you do with him here?

01:03:05.281 --> 01:03:07.200
Since he threatened the life
of the Crown Prince,

01:03:07.867 --> 01:03:09.118
he should be beheaded.

01:03:11.245 --> 01:03:15.124
However, we cannot kill
the one and only son of the Gwanju.

01:03:16.042 --> 01:03:17.752
So instead, we ought to amputate the arm

01:03:17.835 --> 01:03:19.712
with which he tried to threaten
the Crown Prince.

01:03:20.379 --> 01:03:21.714
Amputate his arm?

01:03:22.298 --> 01:03:23.925
Your pride must be hurt right now,

01:03:24.008 --> 01:03:26.260
because your pupil, the Prince,
lost to Uk,

01:03:26.344 --> 01:03:29.055
whose gate of energy
has been open for not even ten days!

01:03:29.138 --> 01:03:31.933
You fool, I was going
to be nice about this,

01:03:32.016 --> 01:03:34.268
let it slide out of consideration
for you and the Prince.

01:03:34.352 --> 01:03:35.978
But you've gone completely insane!

01:03:36.062 --> 01:03:39.816
Let Cheonbugwan decide whether it's me
or Jang Uk's arm that's insane.

01:03:39.899 --> 01:03:42.944
- That's it!
- Oh, oh, oh, M-Master, please.

01:03:44.779 --> 01:03:47.365
Both the Prince and Uk agreed
to fight each other.

01:03:47.949 --> 01:03:50.243
We have brought Uk's servant
who witnessed everything.

01:03:51.035 --> 01:03:51.911
Come here.

01:03:53.287 --> 01:03:54.747
It was a fair fight.

01:03:56.207 --> 01:04:00.962
But if you cannot believe us,
why not just let them fight once again?

01:04:05.132 --> 01:04:08.803
Let them fight again?
That's not a bad idea.

01:04:10.221 --> 01:04:12.056
Since you claim he wasn't threatening
the Prince

01:04:12.139 --> 01:04:14.642
and that it was a fair fight
between mages,

01:04:15.852 --> 01:04:18.813
why don't we have an official duel
between the Crown Prince and Jang Uk?

01:04:18.896 --> 01:04:21.732
Duel between Uk and the Prince?

01:04:22.316 --> 01:04:25.528
If you can't agree to that,
hand Uk over to Cheonbugwan.

01:04:25.611 --> 01:04:27.655
But if you accept this, then,

01:04:28.239 --> 01:04:31.200
even if one of them dies,
no one will be held responsible

01:04:32.243 --> 01:04:33.953
as per the customs of Daeho.

01:04:35.121 --> 01:04:35.997
Uh…

01:04:45.631 --> 01:04:48.259
We came here to resolve it,
but we only made things worse.

01:04:48.843 --> 01:04:53.014
I let that sly snake
somehow get the better of me.

01:04:53.097 --> 01:04:55.349
Uk will die if he duels
against the Crown Prince.

01:04:55.433 --> 01:04:57.393
- What do we do?
- Do not worry.

01:04:57.476 --> 01:04:59.896
The Crown Prince
will not accept the challenge.

01:05:00.897 --> 01:05:03.524
Ever since Master Seogyeong
founded Songrim,

01:05:03.608 --> 01:05:06.903
there has never been a duel
between the royal family and the mages.

01:05:06.986 --> 01:05:08.571
Both sides have respected

01:05:08.654 --> 01:05:10.031
a kind of unwritten rule

01:05:10.114 --> 01:05:13.534
to keep them from wasting their energy
on each other.

01:05:14.118 --> 01:05:15.202
There is no way

01:05:15.286 --> 01:05:18.664
the Crown Prince would break that rule
just to fight against Uk.

01:05:27.673 --> 01:05:29.884
Accept the challenge, Your Highness.

01:05:30.468 --> 01:05:32.762
I don't see why I should be at odds

01:05:32.845 --> 01:05:34.764
with Songrim over that fool.

01:05:34.847 --> 01:05:38.851
We're lucky to have a favorable scenario
that they cannot blame us for.

01:05:38.935 --> 01:05:42.313
You can prove exactly how strong you are
to everyone in Songrim,

01:05:42.396 --> 01:05:43.230
Your Royal Highness.

01:06:03.876 --> 01:06:05.461
They're from Cheonbugwan
and the palace.

01:06:06.045 --> 01:06:07.004
What's going on?

01:06:07.922 --> 01:06:09.840
Argh, seriously, though, Master Heo Yeom.

01:06:10.633 --> 01:06:12.593
He was so certain
that nothing would happen to him.

01:06:12.677 --> 01:06:13.844
What is this?

01:06:15.304 --> 01:06:16.389
What will happen to Uk now?

01:06:19.725 --> 01:06:22.603
I don't understand what's going on.
Why are they all here right now?

01:06:22.687 --> 01:06:25.856
I was actually here
to talk to you about that.

01:06:26.440 --> 01:06:28.567
But it looks like Jin Mu beat me to it.

01:06:29.986 --> 01:06:31.153
Jin Mu, you say?

01:06:31.946 --> 01:06:34.281
Did something happen again?

01:06:36.117 --> 01:06:37.618
Ugh, damn it!

01:06:37.702 --> 01:06:39.537
His Royal Highness,
the Crown Prince,

01:06:39.620 --> 01:06:41.872
has challenged Jang Uk to a duel.

01:06:44.542 --> 01:06:46.669
The Assistant Gwanju has instructed it

01:06:46.752 --> 01:06:48.504
that Jang Uk be brought to Cheonbugwan,

01:06:48.587 --> 01:06:51.007
if he refuses to participate in the duel.

01:06:51.590 --> 01:06:54.510
Jang Uk is already locked up
in the prison of Songrim.

01:06:56.429 --> 01:06:59.849
And you want to transfer him?
What is this about?

01:06:59.932 --> 01:07:01.642
Please ask Master Heo.

01:07:02.351 --> 01:07:05.730
I was told
they had already come to an agreement.

01:07:14.697 --> 01:07:17.408
Uk, get up. You need to get out of here.

01:07:18.075 --> 01:07:19.326
Why?

01:07:19.410 --> 01:07:22.788
No time to explain. If you don't leave
right now, you'll… lose your arm.

01:07:23.706 --> 01:07:25.458
Or you might even be killed.

01:07:26.042 --> 01:07:27.334
- What?
- Young Master.

01:07:27.918 --> 01:07:29.462
Things have gotten serious.

01:07:29.545 --> 01:07:31.964
If you continue just lying in here,
you could lose your life.

01:07:33.174 --> 01:07:34.550
Will you still do nothing?

01:07:45.895 --> 01:07:48.022
I will go with Jang Uk
to the royal palace

01:07:48.689 --> 01:07:50.441
to meet with the Crown Prince.

01:07:51.025 --> 01:07:52.985
They will bring Uk soon,
so just wait here.

01:07:57.656 --> 01:07:58.532
Where is he?

01:07:58.616 --> 01:08:01.869
He's not in the secret room.
He must have escaped somehow.

01:08:02.495 --> 01:08:03.579
What?

01:08:10.169 --> 01:08:13.214
When you have no better option,

01:08:13.297 --> 01:08:16.675
fleeing may be your best bet.

01:08:17.718 --> 01:08:18.677
Uh…

01:08:23.307 --> 01:08:26.143
He was here all along,
and only his servant came and went.

01:08:26.727 --> 01:08:28.312
I don't understand how he fled.

01:08:31.107 --> 01:08:32.817
Where are Yul and Dang-gu right now?

01:08:41.659 --> 01:08:45.287
Our leader will handle it.
Lie low until the dust settles.

01:08:46.539 --> 01:08:49.291
Mu-deok, please take good care of him.

01:08:50.209 --> 01:08:53.212
Are you sure you really don't need us
to come with you?

01:08:53.295 --> 01:08:55.881
Yes. We are going to the place
I used to live.

01:08:55.965 --> 01:08:57.842
I heard Sari Village, was it?

01:08:57.925 --> 01:09:00.845
Stay there, then, and we will come
to get you as soon as we can.

01:09:06.851 --> 01:09:09.061
You've managed
to put him in danger once again.

01:09:12.481 --> 01:09:14.608
Then he'll get what he wants once more.

01:09:42.136 --> 01:09:46.932
This duel will take place
the middle of next month.

01:09:47.016 --> 01:09:49.143
That will be the end of it.

01:09:52.021 --> 01:09:55.941
Then, if Jang Uk
does not appear on that day…

01:09:58.027 --> 01:09:59.862
please accept that as his defeat.

01:09:59.945 --> 01:10:02.406
That is just fleeing, not losing.

01:10:04.575 --> 01:10:07.161
There should be consequences
for such a cowardly defeat.

01:10:09.747 --> 01:10:11.373
Jin Mu speaks the truth.

01:10:11.957 --> 01:10:14.793
If Jang Uk does not appear
at the dueling ground,

01:10:14.877 --> 01:10:17.087
he will be deprived of his right to become

01:10:18.297 --> 01:10:19.215
the next Gwanju.

01:10:27.306 --> 01:10:29.308
I understand, Sire.

01:10:47.076 --> 01:10:48.786
Why bring that when we're fleeing?

01:10:50.329 --> 01:10:51.830
Because you need this to train.

01:10:51.914 --> 01:10:54.500
Train? I thought we were just trying
to run away?

01:10:56.085 --> 01:10:58.587
- Were you behind all this?
- Yeah, I merely played a part.

01:10:59.088 --> 01:11:02.007
You had to hear you might lose your life
before you'd finally move.

01:11:04.093 --> 01:11:05.344
What?

01:11:05.427 --> 01:11:07.429
I have no need for a pupil
who won't improve.

01:11:08.472 --> 01:11:10.891
If you're not going to do anything,
you should just die.

01:11:11.475 --> 01:11:12.893
So you've poisoned me again,

01:11:13.894 --> 01:11:15.688
my crazy master.

01:11:16.355 --> 01:11:17.314
Jang Uk.

01:11:18.190 --> 01:11:20.442
We're going to the place
where I used to train.

01:11:20.526 --> 01:11:21.694
You should brace yourself now.

01:11:22.194 --> 01:11:25.322
Where we're going,
there will be no more warm baths for you.

01:11:25.823 --> 01:11:27.366
There will be no cozy beds,

01:11:28.284 --> 01:11:30.327
none of that delicious food
you love so much.

01:11:32.496 --> 01:11:35.457
Is Sari Village really that scary?

01:11:36.375 --> 01:11:38.919
Sari Village
was where Mu-deok used to live.

01:11:39.003 --> 01:11:40.879
Where Naksu is from…

01:11:42.047 --> 01:11:43.424
is Danhyanggok.

01:11:45.801 --> 01:11:47.428
And that is where we are heading now.

01:12:43.984 --> 01:12:45.778
Why are all these things
around here?

01:12:45.861 --> 01:12:46.987
Mu-deok. Wow.

01:12:47.071 --> 01:12:49.406
I thought for a second you were using
training as an excuse

01:12:49.490 --> 01:12:51.742
to kidnap your Young Master
and settle down with him.

01:12:51.825 --> 01:12:54.870
I have so much to teach you,
lots and lots of things.

01:12:54.953 --> 01:12:57.664
You just described
the most dangerous kind of woman!

01:12:57.748 --> 01:12:59.249
I don't enjoy sweet things, either.

01:12:59.333 --> 01:13:01.543
If you do not wish to eat,
then just leave.

01:13:01.627 --> 01:13:03.003
Mu-deok's making breakfast with Yul.

01:13:03.087 --> 01:13:04.963
Oh goodness, I told you…

01:13:05.047 --> 01:13:07.174
Yes, yes, I am angry.
How dare you teach some other guy

01:13:07.257 --> 01:13:08.967
when you have a pupil
who is alive and well?

01:13:09.051 --> 01:13:11.678
How about we strip Jang Uk
of his rights to be a mage?

01:13:12.221 --> 01:13:15.099
Jang Uk has no one to teach him.

01:13:15.182 --> 01:13:17.476
There's a great soul
who shifted into this body.

01:13:18.435 --> 01:13:19.478
Mu-deok, run!

01:13:19.561 --> 01:13:20.938
I didn't want to do anything…

01:13:21.021 --> 01:13:22.356
But she's the last thing stopping me.
